[b]AI Limit - Difficulty Scaling[/b]

Difficulty scaling mod for AI Limit. Pick a preset, drop it in, play.

A MelonLoader mod for [b]AI Limit[/b] that lets you customize game difficulty through presets. Choose from 5 difficulty levels plus a custom preset.

[b]Requirements[/b]

[list]
[*][url=https://melon-loader.com/]MelonLoader[/url] 0.7.3+ installed for AI Limit
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]

[list]
[*]Download and install MelonLoader for AI Limit if you haven't already
[*]Copy [b]DifficultyScaling.dll[/b] and the [b]DifficultyScaling_cfg/[/b] folder into your game's [b]Mods/[/b] directory:
[/list]

[code]<game>/Mods/
    DifficultyScaling.dll
    DifficultyScaling_cfg/
        difficulty.03_normal
        Difficulty/
            00_custom/scaling.toml
            01_story/scaling.toml
            02_easy/scaling.toml
            03_normal/scaling.toml
            04_adept/scaling.toml
            05_hard/scaling.toml[/code]

[list]
[*][b]Select your difficulty[/b] by renaming the flag file. For example, to play on Easy, rename:
[b]difficulty.03_normal[/b] → [b]difficulty.02_easy[/b]
[/list]

[b]How to Change Difficulty[/b]

The mod reads the empty flag file named [b]difficulty.<preset>[/b] to determine which preset to load. You can use the [b]number[/b] or [b]name[/b] (case-insensitive):

[list]
[*][b]difficulty.00[/b] or [b]difficulty.custom[/b] — Custom (edit the TOML yourself)
[*][b]difficulty.01[/b] or [b]difficulty.story[/b] — Story
[*][b]difficulty.02[/b] or [b]difficulty.easy[/b] — Easy
[*][b]difficulty.03[/b] or [b]difficulty.normal[/b] — Normal
[*][b]difficulty.04[/b] or [b]difficulty.adept[/b] — Adept (base game values)
[*][b]difficulty.05[/b] or [b]difficulty.hard[/b] — Hard
[/list]

Only one [b]difficulty.*[/b] file should exist at a time.

[b]Preset Values[/b]

[list]
[*][b]Story[/b] — Monster Atk x0.4 | Monster Def x0.4 | Player Atk x1.5 | Player Def x1.2 | Player HP x1.5
[*][b]Easy[/b] — Monster Atk x0.6 | Monster Def x0.6 | Player Atk x1.2 | Player Def x1.2 | Player HP x1.35
[*][b]Normal[/b] — Monster Atk x0.8 | Monster Def x0.85 | Player Atk x1.1 | Player Def x1.1 | Player HP x1.2
[*][b]Adept[/b] — Monster Atk x1.0 | Monster Def x1.0 | Player Atk x1.0 | Player Def x1.0 | Player HP x1.0
[*][b]Hard[/b] — Monster Atk x1.2 | Monster Def x1.25 | Player Atk x0.9 | Player Def x0.9 | Player HP x0.9
[/list]

All multipliers are relative to the base game. [b]Adept[/b] is identical to vanilla.

[b]Custom Preset[/b]

Edit [b]DifficultyScaling_cfg/Difficulty/00_custom/scaling.toml[/b] with your own values, then set the flag to [b]difficulty.00[/b] or [b]difficulty.custom[/b]:

[code]monster_attack_multiplier = 0.80
monster_defense_multiplier = 0.85
player_attack_multiplier = 1.05
player_defense_multiplier = 1.05
player_hp_multiplier = 1.2[/code]

[b]Debug Logging[/b]

Add [b]debug = true[/b] to any preset's [b]scaling.toml[/b] to enable verbose logging in the MelonLoader console.

[b]Source Code[/b]

Available on [url=https://github.com/CyrixJD115/AI-Limit_DifficultyScaling_Mod]GitHub[/url].
